         "Adderall XR",
         "Vyvanse"
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "BEHAVIORAL",
        "name": "Cognitive behavioral therapy",
        "description": "12 sessions of group cognitive behavioral therapy. Participants also receive individual coaching 3 times a week (twice over telephone and once in person). Coaching sessions are 15 minutes each in duration and are aimed at implementation, practice, and generalization of skills acquired in therapy.",
        "armGroupLabels": [
         "Cognitive behavioral therapy + medication",
